From: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: arm64: dts: allwinner: h616: Cover the codec RAMP register

The codec node maps 0x31c bytes, but the driver uses AC_RAMP_REG at
offset 0x31c (H616 user manual v1.0, 8.4.6.56 at 0x31c;
the regmap max_register is 0x31c). The access works only because ioremap
rounds up to a page. Make the region 0x320 bytes.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
---

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h616.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h616.dtsi
@@ -1171,7 +1171,7 @@
 		codec: codec@5096000 {
 			#sound-dai-cells = <0>;
 			compatible = "allwinner,sun50i-h616-codec";
-			reg = <0x05096000 0x31c>;
+			reg = <0x05096000 0x320>;
 			interrupts = <GIC_SPI 58 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>;
 			clocks = <&ccu CLK_BUS_AUDIO_CODEC>,
 				 <&ccu CLK_AUDIO_CODEC_1X>;
-- 
Armbian
